data_pdse2
# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [pdse2].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Ambient orthorhombic Pbca PdSe2: Soulard et al., Inorg. Chem. 43,
# 1943--1949 (2004), doi:10.1021/ic0352396; COD 4310736. The room-temperature
# single-crystal refinement gives a=5.7457, b=5.8679, c=7.6946 A and Se 8c
# (x,y,z)=(0.11125(4),0.11799(3),0.40573(3)), R=0.0176. The 4a Pd and 8c Se
# sites are expanded explicitly below. Weakly bonded layers stack along c,
# so the catalog uses a c-axis-normal slab.
# Validation: pdse2-pbca-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 5.7457
_cell_length_b 5.8679
_cell_length_c 7.6946
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 90.0
